<section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.8 1c0 2-3 3-3 3M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Does this Tool use AI?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">No. It uses a fixed word list and a search through touching tiles, so the same board always gives the same results. Screenshot uploads read each letter by comparing its shape with letter patterns, and that also runs in your browser.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Can I use it on Android?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">Yes. It runs in any modern browser on Android, iPhone, iPad, or a computer. GamePigeon itself only runs in iMessage on Apple devices.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Is it free?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">Yes. It's free to use, with no account or signup.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Do I need to download an App?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">No. Open this page and start typing or upload a screenshot.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Can I upload a Screenshot of my Board?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">Yes. Upload a screenshot from your iPhone, iPad, Android phone, or computer. The solver reads the letters, works out the grid size, and fills in the board. Check the letters, fix any tile it misread, then tap Solve.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Is Word Hunt scored like Scrabble?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">No. Scrabble gives letters different values and has bonus squares. Word Hunt scores by word length only.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Does it work on 5x5 and 6x6 Boards?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">Yes. Set the rows and columns to match your board, from 3x3 up to 6x6.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Does it work for Word Hunt on iMessage?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">Yes. Type the letters from your iMessage board in the same layout, or upload a screenshot, then tap Solve.</p></div>
<div class="card mt-3 !p-5"><p class="flex items-start gap-3 font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"><span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700">Q</span><span>Is this Site affiliated with GamePigeon?</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 pl-10">No. This is an independent site with no connection to GamePigeon or Apple.</p></div>
</section>
